   "issue": "`transvectionWeylElement_inv_conj_transvectionUnit_left` (line 338) and `..._right` (line 348) duplicate `transvectionWeylElement_conj_transvectionUnit_left/right` (lines 268, 304): since `(transvectionWeylElement hij)\u207b\u00b9 = transvectionWeylElement hij.symm`, instantiating the forward lemmas at `hij.symm` gives exactly the two inverse statements. They are also stated with `((transvectionWeylElement hij)\u207b\u00b9)\u207b\u00b9` on the right, so they do not `rw` against the natural goal `w\u207b\u00b9 * x * w`. `transvectionWeylElement_inv` (line 261) likewise gives only the raw three-factor word instead of the canonical opposite-root element.",
